              context: `One of the foundational studies establishing that music produces dopamine release in specific brain regions at "chills" moments. Used PET imaging to track dopamine release in 8 participants listening to music they'd selected as personally peak-emotion music. Found dopamine release in caudate (anticipation phase) and nucleus accumbens (peak experience phase). Has been substantially cited in subsequent research.`,
