              context: `The "Solfeggio frequencies" framework was developed by Joseph Puleo, a 1990s naturopath who claimed to derive specific frequencies from Bible numerology. 528 Hz is claimed to be the "frequency of love" with specific healing and consciousness effects. The framework has been amplified through wellness culture: YouTube channels with hundreds of millions of views; books; tuning forks sold as healing instruments; "528 Hz music" available for purchase; specific claims about DNA repair, miracle healing, consciousness elevation.`,
